      },
      "message": "fix(data): remove incorrect Zihpm dependency from COUNTINHIBIT_EN\n\nThe parameter description incorrectly stated that COUNTINHIBIT_EN[3:31]\nmust all be false if Zihpm is not implemented. This constraint was wrong\nbecause:\n\n1. Zihpm controls user-mode access to HPM counters (hpmcounter* CSRs)\n2. mcountinhibit is a machine-mode CSR that controls whether counters advance\n3. These are orthogonal - M-mode can inhibit counters even without U-mode access\n\nThe constraint was also redundant since the description already states that\nunimplemented counters (HPM_COUNTER_EN[n] = false) cannot be inhibited.\n\nCloses #1320",
